   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Most Of What I Like** (1 other source): Included Praise You teases and was dedicated to the performer's wife Edith [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **bit recording**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [10]\n- **Most Of What I Like**: rare: 10 archived performances [10]\n- **Aerodynamic**: rare: 10 archived performances [10]\n- **Sense &gt**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [10]\n- **The Silver Cord**: rare: 13 archived performances [10]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2025-08-17.mk21-discocape** (recommended): source not stated; 20 songs; 178 min; rated 4.8/5 by 5 [1]. Said about its sound: Tracking appears off, but the overall audio quality is described as really good; The recording is praised for its excellent sound quality; The recording is rated as excellent [4][7][8]\n- **kglw2025-08-17.dpa4006-decca.flac24**: source not stated; 19 songs; 176 min [3]\n- **kglw2025-08-17.SBD.wav**: soundboard; 19 songs; 176 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Recording dedicated to Matt Gawiak, who passed away on August 15, 2025 [2]\n- The band performed in drag costumes for the third annual drag night [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2025-08-17.mk21-discocape**: taped by discocape; transferred by discocape; source: Schoeps cmc1k/mk21's [1]. Also: Schoeps cmc1k/mk21 mics in ORTF, mixed via mixpre 6ii at 32/48, by discocape [1]\n- **kglw2025-08-17.dpa4006-decca.flac24**: taped by Scott Schneider; transferred by Scott Schneider; source: 3xDPA 4006c w/30mm APE Spheres(Decca Tree[0.5m spacing from center]/LOC at front corner of FOH/10')->Sonosax->SD744t(24bit/96kHz) [3]\n- **kglw2025-08-17.SBD.wav**: source: SBD [2]",
